OL,3,APeople deserve to 'feel safe' after
OL,4,Acrash and fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrown told Radio 4's Today programme he
OL,7,Fhad called an "urgent meeting" on
OL,8,FFriday among councillors, police and
OL,9,Fsocial housing providers.
OL,11,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham said any
OL,12,Fsupport local police officers and
OL,13,Fauthorities required would be provided.
